OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after bus stolen and driven
OL,4,Ainto vehicles
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after a bus
OL,7,Fdriver was allegedly assaulted and his
OL,8,Fvehicle stolen before it crashed into
OL,9,Fmultiple vehicles in Shropshire.
OL,11,FOfficers were called to Court Street in
OL,12,FMadeley, Telford, at about 18.35 BST on
OL,13,FFriday following reports a bus driver
OL,14,Fhad been attacked.
OL,16,FThe driver was ejected from the bus
OL,17,Fduring the assault, West Merica Police
OL,18,Fsaid, before it was driven along Park
OL,19,FWay towards the High Street, travelling
OL,20,Fon the wrong side of the road and
OL,21,Fhitting several vehicles.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
